WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.366
This is AI Finance Coach: a private coach for your household's money, running on your own machine.

2
00:00:07.466 --> 00:00:08.959
First, the big picture.

3
00:00:10.059 --> 00:00:17.743
Your bank accounts sync through Europe's open-banking rules, and every payment is sorted by your rules and by what you taught it.

4
00:00:17.743 --> 00:00:23.104
The dashboard shows a usual month, your cash flow, a ninety-day forecast and your budgets.

5
00:00:23.104 --> 00:00:28.107
Subscriptions, loans, net worth and the kids' pocket money each have their own page.

6
00:00:34.426 --> 00:00:36.069
Then, ask in plain words.

7
00:00:37.169 --> 00:00:39.911
The coach never reads your raw transactions.

8
00:00:39.911 --> 00:00:47.451
It calls read-only tools that compute the figures on redacted data, and every claim links back to the payments behind it.

9
00:00:53.502 --> 00:00:55.123
Every label is explained.

10
00:00:56.223 --> 00:01:00.566
Open any payment to see why it has its category and who it belongs to.

11
00:01:00.566 --> 00:01:02.986
Change it, and you see a preview first.

12
00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:09.795
Keep your subscriptions under control.

13
00:01:10.895 --> 00:01:18.409
Price rises, overlapping services, notice periods and contracts, with cheaper offers that are dated and sourced.

14
00:01:18.409 --> 00:01:20.623
The savings are computed by code.

15
00:01:26.028 --> 00:01:30.835
Your data stays yours: nothing leaves your machine without a typed yes.

16
00:01:30.835 --> 00:01:33.002
AI Finance Coach is open source.

17
00:01:33.002 --> 00:01:34.220
Find it on GitHub.
